    91	        <SourcedBlock source="usa-today-kraft-2026-09-14" kind="record" detail>
    92	          <p>Kraft's full statement names the two Gillette dates and gives his rationale for the refusal.<Cite s="usa-today-kraft-2026-09-14" passage="his participation in the September 25th and 26th concerts at Gillette Stadium would cross that line" /></p>
    93	        </SourcedBlock>
    94	        <SourcedBlock source="wsj-tour-phone-call-2026-09-16" kind="record" detail>
    95	          <p>The Wall Street Journal, citing people familiar with the matter, reported that Carolina Panthers owner David Tepper, Atlanta Falcons owner Arthur Blank and Philadelphia Eagles owner Jeffrey Lurie joined the broader venue pressure. The report does not supply the owners' communications or the tour contracts.<Cite s="wsj-tour-phone-call-2026-09-16" passage="More than that, several other National Football League owners were also ready to cancel Sheeran’s dates as long as Macklemore remained on the bill." /><Cite s="wsj-tour-phone-call-2026-09-16" passage="David Tepper and Arthur Blank" /><Cite s="wsj-tour-phone-call-2026-09-16" passage="Philadelphia Eagles owner Jeffrey Lurie would soon reach the same conclusion" /></p>
    96	        </SourcedBlock>
