   148	
   149	        <SourcedBlock source="ap-philadelphia-outcome-2026-09-19" kind="record" detail>
   150	          <p>AP's revised Philadelphia report records the completed concert, the absence of an opener, Sheeran's remarks and the demonstration.<Cite s="ap-philadelphia-outcome-2026-09-19" passage="Sheeran began the concert alone on stage with no opener" /></p>
   151	        </SourcedBlock>
   152	        <SourcedBlock source="cair-philadelphia-records-request-2026-09-17" kind="record" detail>
   153	          <p>The request seeks communications and authority records while stating that it does not presume what the records will show.<Cite s="cair-philadelphia-records-request-2026-09-17" passage="the request does not presume what those records will show" /></p>
   154	        </SourcedBlock>
   155	        <SourcedBlock source="nyt-philadelphia-outcome-2026-09-19" kind="record" detail>
   156	          <p>The New York Times reported that the Philadelphia show started two hours later without an opening act. Its account also preserves Sheeran's fuller remarks on the October 7 attack, Gaza and the West Bank.<Cite s="nyt-philadelphia-outcome-2026-09-19" passage="Sheeran performed without an opening act, and the show’s start time was pushed back two hours." /><Cite s="nyt-philadelphia-outcome-2026-09-19" passage="He called the Oct. 7 Hamas attack “horrific.”" /><Cite s="nyt-philadelphia-outcome-2026-09-19" passage="And the systemic injustice we’re seeing unfold in the West Bank, it cannot be overlooked." /></p>
   157	        </SourcedBlock>
   158	        <SourcedBlock source="ap-donations-2026-09-19" kind="record" detail>
   159	          <p>AP recorded Macklemore's $1 million relief pledge and six recipients. Kraft separately said he would match Sheeran's $2 million aid pledge, but the statement did not name the recipients.<Cite s="ap-donations-2026-09-19" passage="$1 million pledge from rapper Macklemore" /><Cite s="ap-donations-2026-09-19" passage="The six donation recipients" /><Cite s="ap-donations-2026-09-19" passage="he would match Sheeran’s own $2 million donation for aid" /><Cite s="ap-donations-2026-09-19" passage="The post did not specify the gift’s recipients." /></p>
   160	        </SourcedBlock>
